# AI-drafted rule, skill, and memory change proposals awaiting human approval.
#
# Format: proposal-YYYY-MM-DD-NN-brief-title.md
#
# Each proposal must include:
#   - What should change (specific file and section)
#   - Why it should change (evidence from sessions)
#   - Proposed new content
#   - Priority: High/Medium/Low
#   - Status: Proposed | Approved | Rejected
#
# No rule, skill, or memory changes are applied without explicit human sign-off.
